{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1462649-counter-teleportation","id":1462649,"title":"Counter Teleportation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-04T06:51:10-07:00","id":1462649,"title":"Counter Teleportation","content":"Hey,<br /> <br /> I would like to pick some brains.<br /> <br /> We're up against an enemy mage, they have at least corr 3. How do you stop them from teleporting out of the building before you reach them?<br /> <br /> The building is warded so your unsure their location. And you do not know their identity.<br /> <br /> Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T10:52:48-07:00","id":1462673,"title":"","content":"Why do you need to reach them? Presumably to attack them, so I\u2019ll assume that. <br /> <br /> Bomb the building from orbit via the Zeus orbital strike platform, assuming you can requisition the strike. You\u2019ll have to justify it to the local construct. This is essentially a Forces 4/5 attack that will level the building, if you\u2019re a tradition reality deviant. <br /> <br /> Or first surround the building with ERROR anti-magick emitters and switch them on before you rush in. Be quick thou, they burn through their primal energy batteries pretty quick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26904-breggie","name":"breggie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26904_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T12:11:20-07:00","id":1462690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jasper mage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1462649-counter-teleportation#post1462649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey,<br /> <br /> I would like to pick some brains.<br /> <br /> We're up against an enemy mage, they have at least corr 3. How do you stop them from teleporting out of the building before you reach them?<br /> <br /> The building is warded so your unsure their location. And you do not know their identity.<br /> <br /> Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>How large is this building and how many people occupy its interior?<br /> <br /> If it's an office building and your last session ended with your troupe inside the building during the day, there are plenty of walls and ceilings to insulate against sensory Magick and large number of people to confuse your search efforts. If there are not that many people, you can use Spheres other than Correspondence to try to find the enemy Mage. A level 1 Forces effect with enough successes should be able to see a human heat signature through a single wall.<br /> <br /> However, you might not be able to find this person at all for one basic reason. It may be that the storyteller has put some thought into this NPC-adversary and s/he has Plot Armor. It's meant to be a series of chases and investigations that lead you through other parts of the story. As a player, if I thought this was the case, I would just run through it as quickly as possible making very basic attempts to find the NPC, instead of debating as a group about the solution. Let the story unfold and the ST will be more than happy to award XP. Try your sensory abilities and assess whether you think this is a puzzle with a solution or planned series of dramatic scenes. Act accordingly.<br /> <br /> If there is another available target who is of the same faction as this NPC, you could advance toward them to try and force the Correspondence Mage to backup their college. Another thing that occurs to me is that the Corr-Mage may have lured you to this building to force you to run past Hyper-Technology security cameras that penetrate any Arcane you have. He wants to facilitate future uses of scrying Magick against you. The extreme solution of destroying the entire building is.. an option that carries with it the potential to pick up a lot of Jhor if there are sleepers inside. <br /> <br /> Good luck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T12:24:07-07:00","id":1462692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1462649-counter-teleportation?p=1462690#post1462690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026The extreme solution of destroying the entire building is.. an option that carries with it the potential to pick up a lot of Jhor if there are sleepers inside. <br /> <br /> Good luck.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair I was picturing an otherwise abandoned building in my head, else the wards the OP mentioned would be triggered nonstop by sleepers coming and going, and therefore easy to slip past oneself.<br /> <br /> If someone in the group has data/correspondence 2, you could always peek in and find the offending mage and try to counter their escape (countermagick). No guarantees, but it might work long enough to get to them physically if that\u2019s what the goal is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26904-breggie","name":"breggie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26904_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T14:20:51-07:00","id":1462710,"title":"","content":"Ideally we don't want to destroy the building. As it's our chantry that has been taken over by an enemy mage and that would mean sacrificing the node ;P<br /> <br /> It's also likely a mystic practitioner (enemy disperate is the suspected group). And we're all trad mages. Though they have only taken it for a month so if it is techno we think it's unlikely they've managed to transform the place with hyper tech. but some upgrades to the building has been noticed.<br /> <br /> They do have what we believe sleeper helpers though. Which I'm less worried about dealing with. (knockout gas with matter+corr)<br /> <br /> It's really the bad guy mage i'm worried about getting away. I think we can retake the building.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T14:38:57-07:00","id":1462714,"title":"","content":"How are these Acolytes or Retainers attending to their needs from day to day? Does anyone go out for groceries? Is there a pantry or greenhouse that would extend the amount of time they could stay in there without seeking a food source?<br /> <br /> Avoid directly targeting this Mage with scrying Magick. If someone in your Cabal has Mind, get within line of sight to any one of these people and plumb their memories for an impression of the Mage. Figure out the details of the relationship between the Mage and the other occupants. Where are the sleepers from, geographically? <br /> <br /> Also, who legally owns the property?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-04T15:35:25-07:00","id":1462722,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I think you're tackling the problem from a too direct angle, and that may even be the reason you got yourselves in this situation to begin with. You gave us no information about your prey except they have Corr 3, so it seems that you don't think information is important for the &quot;encounter&quot;.<br /> <br /> If you're playing Mage, information is everything.<br /> <br /> What do you know about them? About their Paradigm? About their identity? Other Spheres?<br /> <br /> Stopping teleport from working is just a matter of applying a Correspondence or Prime ward, but if the enemy has been holding a fucking Chantry for a month, it isn't exactly likely that you'll be able to pull this off.<br /> <br /> Focus on gathering information. Learning ways to reach the enemy indirectly. Or just retake the Chantry and worry about that later. Don't play a Mage as if you were a Werewolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-05T03:26:19-07:00","id":1462786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1462649-counter-teleportation?p=1462714#post1462714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Avoid directly targeting this Mage with scrying Magick. If someone in your Cabal has Mind, get within line of sight to any one of these people and plumb their memories for an impression of the Mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oooh I like this idea. thats a good one for if they get away and we have managed to knock out their helpers. Can you do that with mind 2? thats the best mind we have in our cabal.<br /> <br /> The building is warded against scrying, and a decent number of sphere viewing effects from my understanding. So finding the mage inside the building isn't possible. also the people haven't been seen leaving the building so we think they're teleporting in and out. Which is bold considering there is no sanctum for them to attune to. there is a cultist and choirister sanctum but I don't think any disperate can benefit from these besides the templars and we don't think its them.<br /> <br /> Legally I think the building was in the deacons name, but they have captured/ killed the deacon. I've asked the VA to check the mundane side of things, with building ownership and bills ect. but his been a little lack luster on it :T<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Yeah, I think you're tackling the problem from a too direct angle, and that may even be the reason you got yourselves in this situation to begin with. You gave us no information about your prey except they have Corr 3, so it seems that you don't think information is important for the &quot;encounter&quot;. </div> </div> </div>unfortunetly I've not got much info to work with. The only thing we know about the mage is they definetly have corr because they teleported into the building.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-05T08:56:44-07:00","id":1462803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jasper mage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1462649-counter-teleportation?p=1462786#post1462786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">unfortunetly I've not got much info to work with. The only thing we know about the mage is they definetly have corr because they teleported into the building.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you have no information you should focus on getting it instead of trying to counter the teleportation, as you don't actually know other things that may be waiting for you there or the abilities of this Mage.<br /> <br /> Let them teleport away if things come to this. Your chantry is now more important than getting them, and once they're gone you can set a proper ward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-05T12:04:51-07:00","id":1462820,"title":"","content":"Use Correspondence and Matter to ward the building itself from afar against teleportation and use Prime to hide the fact that you're doing it. Or create a Life/Forces/Matter Effect that prevents anyone in the building from moving (except people you designate) and then just walk in and deal with the situation. Or approach from the Umbra and get the building's spirit to help you create a Shallowing and let you in that way without alerting the individual concerned. Or create a Mind Effect that makes everyone in the building forget that they're mages. There's any number of ways to skin the cat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-10T20:03:37-07:00","id":1463367,"title":"","content":"Any progress on vanquishing the squatter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T01:20:45-07:00","id":1463555,"title":"","content":"Our session got delayed a week because of life stuff. But we've decided to just teleport into the node room and hopefully the mage and their allies will be there to deal with and just go all out.<br /> At least that way anyone with cor can counterspell any teleport attempt. Less stealthy black ops.... but maybe the direct route is better in this case <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}